# BookMyShow — Complete Project Structure

## Tech Stack
| Layer | Choice |
|-------|--------|
| Runtime | Node.js 22+ (LTS) |
| Framework | Fastify v5 |
| Language | TypeScript 5.x |
| Validation | Zod 3 |
| Database | MongoDB 7 |
| Cache & Locks | Redis 7 (Distributed Locking Engine) |
| Search | Elasticsearch 8.15 |
| Observability | Prometheus & Grafana (`prom-client 15`) |
| Bundler | esbuild |
| Linter | Oxlint |
| Load Testing | Grafana k6 |
| Auth | JWT |

