## API Endpoints (Complete)

| Method | Endpoint | Module | Description |
|--------|----------|--------|-------------|
| GET | `/health` | bootstrap | Server uptime and health check |
| GET | `/metrics` | bootstrap | Prometheus runtime & HTTP metrics |
| GET | `/docs` | bootstrap | Swagger UI interactive API docs |
| GET | `/api/v1/cities` | cities | List active cities |
| GET | `/api/v1/cities/:id` | cities | Get single city details |
| GET | `/api/v1/cities/:cityId/cinemas` | cinemas | List cinemas in a city |
| GET | `/api/v1/cinemas/:id` | cinemas | Get single cinema details |
| GET | `/api/v1/cinemas/:cinemaId/shows` | shows | List shows running in a cinema |
| GET | `/api/v1/shows/:id` | shows | Get show details, pricing & availability |
| GET | `/api/v1/shows/:showId/seats` | bookings | Live seat map (Available / Locked / Booked) |
| POST | `/api/v1/shows/:showId/lock` | bookings | Atomic distributed seat reservation (8-min TTL) |
| POST | `/api/v1/bookings/confirm` | bookings | Payment signature verification & DB commit |

